    "scenesThatPass": [
      "NIMONA: A long, long time ago a Kingdom lived in peace.\nNIMONA: Believing they had nothing to fear.\nNIMONA: But lurking in the shadows was a great and terrible evil.\nNIMONA: The monster attacked without warning.",
      "NIMONA ARMADILLO: Woo! Yeah! HA!\nNIMONA: Something, something, something. We win.\nNIMONA: Metal.",
      "NIMONA: Ugh, unclench your mustache. What’s the worst that can happen?\nDIRECTOR: Citizens of the Realm, hello. In light of yesterday’s horrific attack on the Institute, we are taking every precaution to keep you safe.\nDIRECTOR: Please do not be alarmed. This is only a test. Go about your normal lives and rest assured that the Institute has this situation well in han…",
      "NIMONA GORILLA: No. You’re right.\nNIMONA: You deserve a better explanation than that.\nNIMONA: I was just a kid. Cute, little, innocent me.\nNIMONA: I was playing in the woods. Following the birds flying, and the fish swimming, and the deer bounding. They all looked so happy together. But…",
      "NIMONA: They were like this when I got here.\nDIRECTOR: You.\nNIMONA: Me."
    ]
  },
